# Xcode
app/build/
app/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
app/*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
# XCFramework : pur artefact de build, reconstruit via build-xcframework.sh.
# On le sort entièrement de git (était partiel : .a gitignored mais headers/plist
# trackés, ce qui causait des diffs spurious à chaque rebuild).
pinkha.xcframework/

# Local secrets injected via xcconfig (Sentry DSN). Template committed as
# Secrets.xcconfig.example. Copy & fill in to set up locally.
app/Config/Secrets.xcconfig

# iCloud Drive conflict copies — files Apple appends " 2", " 3", etc. when
# multiple devices touch the same blob. Should never be tracked.
* [2-9].*
* [2-9]
*[[:space:]][0-9].plist
